Dreadscale is a quested set of armor for [[Iksar]] [[Shadow Knight]]s. The various pieces require you to traverse much of Kunark to complete.
Both are located in the bottom of the Eastern Tower for Shaman and Shadow Knight building.

A full set (2 bracers) gives a total of 91 AC, +12str, +22sta, +3agi, +13dex, +10int, +10HP, +16sv Magic, +9sv Fire, +9sv Cold, +10sv Disease, +10sv Poison.

